      "revision": {
        "title": "Present Simple: savollar va yakuniy takrorlash",
        "description": "Do / Does savollari, qisqa javoblar va A1 pilotining yakuniy takrori.",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Bugun nimani o'rganamiz?\n\nBu — yakuniy dars. Present Simple **savollari**ni o'rganasiz va oldingi mavzularni (have/has, egalik, to be) **amalda** takrorlaysiz." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 4,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Qoida\n\n| Ega | Savol |\n| --- | --- |\n| **I / you / we / they** | **Do** + ega + fe'l? |\n| **he / she / it** | **Does** + ega + fe'l? |\n\nMisol: *Do you work here?* / *Does she live here?*\n\n## Qisqa javoblar\n\n- Do you ...? → **Yes, I do.** / **No, I don't.**\n- Does he ...? → **Yes, he does.** / **No, he doesn't.**\n\n> **E'tibor bering:** *Does* dan keyin fe'l asosiy shaklda. Noto'g'ri: *Does he works?* → To'g'ri: **Does he work?**" }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "- **A:** Do you speak English? **B:** Yes, I do.\n- **A:** Does she live in Tashkent? **B:** No, she doesn't.\n- **A:** Do they study on Sunday? **B:** No, they don't.\n- **A:** Does he like coffee? **B:** Yes, he does." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PRESENT-SIMPLE-QUESTIONS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "___ he like tea?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "Do" }, { "id": "b", "text": "Does" }, { "id": "c", "text": "Is" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Yakuniy takrorlash\n\nQuyidagi mashqlarda oldingi mavzular ham qaytadan uchraydi:\n\n- **have / has** — egalik\n- **egalik sifatlari** — his / her\n- **to be** savollari — Are you ...?" }
