          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Tabriklaymiz!\n\nSiz A1 asosiy mavzularini yakunladingiz:\n\n- salomlashish va tanishuv\n- **to be** (tasdiq, inkor, savol)\n- sonlar va shaxsiy ma'lumot\n- egalik va oila, **have/has**\n- **Present Simple** (tasdiq, inkor, savol)\n\nEndi oddiy suhbatni ingliz tilida boshlay olasiz." }
